# Leonin Vanguard: "At the beginning of combat on your turn, if you control three or more creatures, this creature gets +1/+1
# until end of turn and you gain 1 life." On turn 1 Bot1 controls two creatures (the Vanguard and an Ornithopter), one short of the
# limit: no trigger (life 20). On turn 3 it casts a second Ornithopter, exactly three (CR 603.4): the Vanguard is 2/2 and Bot1
# gains 1 life (CR 611.2a, 119.3). On Bot2's turn 4 (not "your turn") it does not trigger again, and the first pump has ended
